  "details": "The updated user profiles use significantly more padding and empty space between elements than before. This partially reduces information density, meaning less useful content and buttons fit within the QM and MM at once and requires more scrolling and clicking to view the same amount of information.\n\nPlease reduce the excessive padding and spacing between profile elements or provide a compact density option that reduces spacing to allow more information to be displayed at once.",
